  "_comment": "PS3.15 Basic Application Level Confidentiality Profile + TCIA layered options. Versioned bundle: when DICOM PS3.15 or TCIA's option set ships changes, regenerate this file with a new version number rather than mutating it in place — operators reference a specific filename so policy diffs are an explicit upgrade rather than a silent change.",
